Third-party scope
=================

LICENSES/HOL-Light.txt applies conservatively to this package as a whole. The
closest correspondences are the type and term representations in htype.rhm and
term.rhm and the primitive inference and definitional rules in kernel.rhm.

The package-wide treatment avoids relying on a narrow distinction between
copied expression and a clean reimplementation of HOL Light's public kernel
design.
